# Owo 2.5 — findings by MiniMax M3.1 Flash

- Source: Owo (`opencode/owo-2.5`)
- Date: 2026-11-12 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

> **Self-exclusion notice.** No verified public benchmark number exists for this model id, and no public source could be found that describes such a model at all. Every benchmark row below reads "no verified public score found", so this file is intentionally saved as `MiniMax_M3.1_Flash.md.excluded` and contributes nothing to the averages. What follows is the verified record of the searches performed and the near-misses that were ruled out.

## Model card

- **Name:** Owo 2.5 — the name carried by this repository's curated entry for a September 2026 proprietary LLM. **No vendor, model card, announcement or benchmark for a model of this name was located on the public internet on 2026-11-12.**
- **Short description:** According to the repository's curated metadata only, a proprietary 1M-context multimodal model with tool use, released in September 2026 and served through "the Owo API" and OpenCode Zen. None of that description could be corroborated: no Owo API documentation page exists publicly (the developer section of the only name-matching company site is entirely "Coming Soon"), and OpenCode Zen does not list any `owo` route.
- **Provider / access:** **None verifiable.** The repository's curated entry assigns `opencode/owo-2.5`, but that id is absent from OpenCode's live inference catalogue (`https://opencode.ai/inference/v1/models`), from the Zen model, pricing and deprecation tables (`https://opencode.ai/docs/zen`), from models.dev, from the OpenRouter catalogue and from the Vercel AI Gateway catalogue — all checked 2026-11-12. The name-matching vendor site `www.owo.ai` (OwO.AI) publishes no API reference, no SDK, no model list and no pricing: its Developers page carries three cards, each reading "Coming Soon".
- **Release / knowledge:** The curated entry claims a September 2026 release; **no dated announcement exists to check it against**. No knowledge cutoff is published.
- **IDs:** `opencode/owo-2.5` (repository-curated only; not a live route in any catalogue checked). No Hugging Face repository, no ModelScope repository, no vendor id and no gateway id was found.
- **Context window:** **unverified.** The curated entry claims 1,048,576 total tokens with 256,000 max output; no public catalogue row, vendor page or API response confirms any window size.
- **Modalities:** **unverified.** The curated entry claims text and image in with text out; no public source documents input or output modalities, and no multimodal benchmark exists for the name.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-12):** **unverified.** The curated entry records "$0.40 / $3.20 per 1M in/out (official Owo API docs)", but no such pricing page could be reached — `https://docs.owo.ai/` does not resolve at all, and the OwO.AI developer pages are placeholders. No OpenRouter, Vercel AI Gateway, models.dev or Zen row carries an `owo` price.
- **Architecture:** **unverified and undisclosed.** No parameter count, architecture description, weights or model card exists for this name in any source checked.

